From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gork CI <gork-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:23:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] session-recap-chat-model: follow active chat model by default

Keep recap inference on the active session model unless the user explicitly
sets a local [session_recap].model override. Ignore remote model pins so an
empty local config cannot silently consume quota from a different model.

Preserve low-effort recap sampling and all other remote recap tunables.

Gork-Patch-Id: session-recap-chat-model
Gork-Invariant: recap-follows-chat-model-by-default
Gork-Risk: critical
---
